    "title": "L-P Picks Familiar Face To Be Next Superintendent - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 hours ago At the LP High School board meeting Wednesday evening, the board selected Dr. Clayton Theisinger as retiring Dr. Steven Wrobleski's successor. Theisinger is currently the Superintendent of Putnam County School District. Theisinger will begin his duties in July. He used to be a teacher and administrator at L-P before taking the superintendent job in Granville. Theisinger is a 2006 L-P graduate. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
